is\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/2/2024 3:38:52 PM\",\"epoch\":1719927532.62,\"formatted\":\"7/2/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"fixed position as a status bar; dismissable ideally, but probably not achievable\",\"Id\":\"856770264\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/28/2024 4:54:11 PM\",\"epoch\":1719586451.197,\"formatted\":\"6/28/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"removed the current page from here and brought the h1 closer so it works as a wrapping\",\"Id\":\"856766571\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/28/2024 4:51:30 PM\",\"epoch\":1719586290.599,\"formatted\":\"6/28/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"@Daniel Mutis I think I'm done for this phase. Let's show this to Daniele and Hanna and discuss\",\"Id\":\"856568009\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/28/2024 2:29:16 PM\",\"epoch\":1719577756.207,\"formatted\":\"6/28/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"when there are no icons, the line should 