\",\"epoch\":1752577930.821,\"formatted\":\"7/15/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"I have kept pagination similar to the current standard [here](https://vanillaframework.io/docs/patterns/pagination) and aligned it to the right\",\"Id\":\"1338708135\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/14/2025 6:21:18 PM\",\"epoch\":1752510078.17,\"formatted\":\"7/14/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"I have preserved this url from the docs results pages. These would help the user identify where in the hierarchy the page sits.\",\"Id\":\"1338706585\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/14/2025 6:20:10 PM\",\"epoch\":1752510010.763,\"formatted\":\"7/14/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"This link is to the original google doc, so that anyone with permissions can add a description to the metadata of the file.\",\"Id\":\"1338705612\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/14/2025 6:19:26 PM\",\"epoch\":1752509966.479,\"formatted\":\"7/14/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"@diana.stanciulescu I have added these tags to follow the example of search results in support portal. Do you think this is the correct spacing?\",\"Id\":\"1338704776\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/14/2025 6:18:51 PM\",\"epoch\":1752509931.282,\"formatted\":\"7/14/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"tag, last reviewed date and make the title a link too\",\"Id\":\"1337877236\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/14/2025 10:40:07 AM\",\"epoch\":1752482407.571,\"formatted\":\"7/14/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"proposed scale: font size increases +rhythm of regular/bold at 3 font-sizes\",\"Id\":\"1310271403\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/23/2025 7:08:15 PM\",\"epoch\":1750698495.792,\"formatted\":\"6/23/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"From the meeting:\\n* bold and italics at the body font size reserved for inline emphasis\\n* small caps/uppercase not an option due to the fact case alters meaning in code.\",\"Id\":\"1310271023\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/23/2025 7:07:57 PM\",\"epoch\":1750698477.397,\"formatted\":\"6/23/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"possible compromise\",\"Id\":\"1310209293\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/23/2025 6:22:53 PM\",\"epoch\":1750695773.68,\"formatted\":\"6/23/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"indentation not liked - paragraph spacing prefered\",\"Id\":\"1310209105\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/23/2025 6:22:45 PM\",\"epoch\":1750695765.711,\"formatted\":\"6/23/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"case is not an option - as it matters for code so we can;'t use it\",\"Id\":\"1310208621\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/23/2025 6:22:24 PM\",\"epoch\":1750695744.953,\"formatted\":\"6/23/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"The spacing between the line and the text is too tight\",\"Id\":\"1087417318\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"1/10/2025 2:52:17 PM\",\"epoch\":1736517137.198,\"formatted\":\"1/10/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"The vertical line goes only until the top of \\\"On this page\\\"\",\"Id\":\"1087416905\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"1/10/2025 2:52:00 PM\",\"epoch\":1736517120.491,\"formatted\":\"1/10/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"This should be aligned to the left and is missing a yellow line on the left border\",\"Id\":\"1087416353\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"1/10/2025 2:51:38 PM\",\"epoch\":1736517098.598,\"formatted\":\"1/10/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"This tag should go under the title and the breadcrumb is missing\",\"Id\":\"1087415759\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"1/10/2025 2:51:13 PM\",\"epoch\":1736517073.595,\"formatted\":\"1/10/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"This search bar doesn't look like the vanilla component\",\"Id\":\"1087415275\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"1/10/2025 2:50:54 PM\",\"epoch\":1736517054.479,\"formatted\":\"1/10/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"The font is too small on the side nav. Should be 1rem @Nicolas Bello\",\"Id\":\"1087414878\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"1/10/2025 2:50:38 PM\",\"epoch\":1736517038.397,\"formatted\":\"1/10/2025\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"@Lyubomir Popov do you reckon the search is too close to the top? feels incredibly tight.\",\"Id\":\"880667702\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/19/2024 10:37:13 AM\",\"epoch\":1721378233.937,\"formatted\":\"7/19/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":{\"type\":\"slate\",\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Can search go below the side nav button?\"}],\"id\":\"cl-0\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"It will likely need to be in the same container as breadcrumbs/title.\"}],\"id\":\"cl-1\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"}]}},\"Id\":\"876084349\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Bartek\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/3143c7995b1f1283f9b73c186f707f96?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_b_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/16/2024 3:27:47 PM\",\"epoch\":1721136467.154,\"formatted\":\"7/16/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"@Bartek this is meant to be fixed position at the bottom\",\"Id\":\"875966446\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/16/2024 2:21:13 PM\",\"epoch\":1721132473.231,\"formatted\":\"7/16/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"@Daniel Mutis, @Bartek something like this?\",\"Id\":\"875908651\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/16/2024 1:43:59 PM\",\"epoch\":1721130239.187,\"formatted\":\"7/16/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":{\"type\":\"slate\",\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Does search need to span across the width of 2 columns?\"}],\"id\":\"cl-0\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Current documentation layout doesn't support that. We have 3 columns: left for side nav, main for content, right for table of contents. \"}],\"id\":\"cl-1\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Search was initially planned to be above main content only - not span across. This changes the layout in a significant way.\"}],\"id\":\"cl-2\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"}]}},\"Id\":\"875888840\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Bartek\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/3143c7995b1f1283f9b73c186f707f96?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_b_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/16/2024 1:30:35 PM\",\"epoch\":1721129435.511,\"formatted\":\"7/16/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":{\"type\":\"slate\",\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Why are chevrons moved to the left?\"}],\"id\":\"cl-0\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"If the side navigation is expandable \\\"documentation style\\\", the expand buttons are on the right per current component.\"}],\"id\":\"cl-1\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"We have chevrons on the left in accordion navigation, but this is not what they initially wanted (because it only supports expanding, not navigating).\"}],\"id\":\"cl-2\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Is this expandable, or accordion nav?\"}],\"id\":\"cl-3\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"}]}},\"Id\":\"875881542\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Bartek\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/3143c7995b1f1283f9b73c186f707f96?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_b_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/16/2024 1:25:45 PM\",\"epoch\":1721129145.558,\"formatted\":\"7/16/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"This is so different from current full width documentation layout, that it looks like a new layout completely TBH.\",\"Id\":\"875879835\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Bartek\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/3143c7995b1f1283f9b73c186f707f96?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_b_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/16/2024 1:24:34 PM\",\"epoch\":1721129074.804,\"formatted\":\"7/16/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":{\"type\":\"slate\",\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"@Lyubomir Popov @Daniel Mutis What are the mobile and tablet views for this?\"}],\"id\":\"cl-0\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"What happens with logo, side nav, search, table of contents on smaller screens?\"}],\"id\":\"cl-1\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"}]}},\"Id\":\"875879150\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Bartek\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/3143c7995b1f1283f9b73c186f707f96?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_b_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/16/2024 1:24:06 PM\",\"epoch\":1721129046.553,\"formatted\":\"7/16/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"@Pete French this is the new nav\",\"Id\":\"865766552\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/8/2024 12:17:16 PM\",\"epoch\":1720433836.608,\"formatted\":\"7/8/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"@Pete French\",\"Id\":\"865765705\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/8/2024 12:16:44 PM\",\"epoch\":1720433804.766,\"formatted\":\"7/8/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"This library is a work in progress.  Learn how to contribute to the library.\",\"Id\":\"859986873\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/2/2024 3:38:52 PM\",\"epoch\":1719927532.62,\"formatted\":\"7/2/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"fixed position as a status bar; dismissable ideally, but probably not achievable\",\"Id\":\"856770264\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/28/2024 4:54:11 PM\",\"epoch\":1719586451.197,\"formatted\":\"6/28/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"removed the current page from here and brought the h1 closer so it works as a wrapping\",\"Id\":\"856766571\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/28/2024 4:51:30 PM\",\"epoch\":1719586290.599,\"formatted\":\"6/28/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"@Daniel Mutis I think I'm done for this phase. Let's show this to Daniele and Hanna and discuss\",\"Id\":\"856568009\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/28/2024 2:29:16 PM\",\"epoch\":1719577756.207,\"formatted\":\"6/28/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"when there are no icons, the line should extend to the starting point of the text @Maximilian Blazek\",\"Id\":\"856398569\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/28/2024 12:10:55 PM\",\"epoch\":1719569455.457,\"formatted\":\"6/28/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"is there a way to make the width bigger and have all items resize themselves to the new width, without breaking the component?\",\"Id\":\"856389929\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/28/2024 12:04:46 PM\",\"epoch\":1719569086.829,\"formatted\":\"6/28/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"@Maximilian Blazek when wrapping, the icon should remain aligned with the top row\",\"Id\":\"856389074\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Lyubomir Popov\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b1343048a74133b44f6662c5b0582b6f?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_l_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/28/2024 12:04:10 PM\",\"epoch\":1719569050.031,\"formatted\":\"6/28/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"@Daniel Mutis not sure which is the latest but are we not using 1440 grid?\",\"Id\":\"830400195\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Hayden Chambers\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/b02432dd-ee87-4a9d-994c-60371061a4a8\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"6/6/2024 12:12:42 PM\",\"epoch\":1717668762.598,\"formatted\":\"6/6/2024\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"Divider to show the separation of the chevron.\",\"Id\":\"735761621\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Daniel Mutis\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5178a688-28d4-4278-b488-8cc31f0f544b\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"3/14/2024 4:57:45 PM\",\"epoch\":1710431865.954,\"formatted\":\"3/14/2024\"},\"Resolved\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"3/18/2024 11:59:31 AM\",\"epoch\":1710759571.811,\"formatted\":\"3/18/2024\"}}}]},\"CommentsCount\":39}\n\n\n\n";
